OL,3,GNEWSAFinal phase of major city centre
OL,4,Arevamp unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals have been unveiled for the
OL,7,Fnext phase of a revamp of part of
OL,8,FLeicester city centre.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council said #1.75m had
OL,11,Fbeen set aside for works to make Granby
OL,12,FStreet, between the Belvoir Street
OL,13,Fjunction and Gallowtree Gate, safer and
OL,14,Fmore accessible for pedestrians and
OL,15,Fcyclists.
OL,17,FThe authority has been remodelling the
OL,18,Froad, which connects the city's railway
OL,19,Fstation to its main shopping area, in
OL,20,Fstages since 2022.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
